OL,3,GNEWSACall for community cast to join
OL,4,Apottery play
OL,5,
OL,6,FA theatre is calling for people to join
OL,7,Fa community cast as part of a new play
OL,8,Fbeing written by an Oscar-winning
OL,9,Factor.
OL,11,FRachel Shenton has adapted a version of
OL,12,Fher podcast, Gladstone Girls, to go on
OL,13,Fstage at the New Vic in
OL,14,FNewcastle-under-Lyme, Staffordshire.
OL,16,F"It sounds so cheesy but it is a bit of
OL,17,Fa dream come true," she said. "It's a
OL,18,Fbit surreal," she added, praising the
OL,19,F"gorgeous" venue and "brilliant" team
OL,20,Fbehind it.
